{#-
  Home page layout (SPEC §6 content/index.njk, §20 M1b; HANDOFF §6.1).

  Only content/index.njk uses it. It provides <main id="main"> with no page
  container, so the hero, the trial band and the other sections can each run
  full width and set their own container. No title band (the hero holds the
  page's one H1), no sidebar, no page JavaScript.
-#}
<main id="main" class="home">
  {{ content | safe }}
</main>
